# DotApp Module PHP

See `AIRULES/03-MODULES-AND-ROUTING.md`, `04-CONTROLLERS-AND-RESPONSES.md`, `07-SCHEMA-AND-INSTALL.md`.

## Routes (in module.init.php)

```php
Router::get('/Shop/', 'Shop:Home@index!', Router::STATIC_ROUTE);
Router::before(['/Shop/account', '/Shop/account/*'], '#Shop:Gate@login!');
Router::before(['POST'], ['/api/v1/auth/Shop', '/api/v1/auth/Shop/*'], '#Shop:Gate@loginAndCrc!');
Router::before(['POST'], ['/api/v1/noauth/Shop', '/api/v1/noauth/Shop/*'], '#Shop:Gate@crc!');
```

- Prefixes: `#` Middleware, `*` Models, trailing `!` skips DI
- Params: `{id:i}`, `{x?}`, `{p*}` → `$request->matchData()`
- No named routes, no Laravel `Route::prefix()->group()` — cover an area with `Router::before([$area, $area . '/*'], '#Shop:Gate@login!')` (403 `Response`)
- **MUST:** HTML `/{ModuleName}/…` + `Gate@login` (no CRC). **POST API** `/api/v1/auth|noauth/{Module}/…` + `Gate@loginAndCrc` / `Gate@crc` at the start of `initialize()` — action **MUST NOT** `crcCheck()` again. Wrap login-only handlers in `if (Auth::isLogged() === true)`. `AIRULES/03`
- **MUST:** `initializeRoutes()` = this module’s prefixes only. **MUST NOT** `['*']` unless the user asked for a global hook. `AIRULES/03`
- **Listeners:** `Listeners::initializeRoutes()` may be a **narrower** list (or omit/`null` to inherit). After either list changes: `php dotapper.php --optimize-modules`.
- **Comments:** English. Public Controllers/Middleware PHPDoc **MUST** start with **`CRCchecking —`** (exact prefix/middleware / `this action` / `none`) then a **purpose sentence** then `@param`/`@return` (not tags-only). Labeled **`// Why:`** (logical step), **`// About:`** (what this chunk is), **`// Section:`** (menu/route) — not every line, not unlabeled (`AIRULES/25` §7, `AIRULES/08`)

## Controllers

```php
namespace Dotsystems\App\Modules\Shop\Controllers;
class Home extends \Dotsystems\App\Parts\Controller {
    public static function index($request) {
        return \Dotsystems\App\Parts\Renderer::new()->module('Shop')
            ->setView('home')->setViewVar('title', 'Hi')->renderView();
    }
}
```

With `!` in the route: **no** `Renderer $renderer` type-hints.

## Request input

`$request->data()` is **protected**. `$request->data(true)` is **original**. **MUST** use `true` for passwords, HTML, hashes (`Auth::login` / `createUser`). See `AIRULES/19`.

## Session

`DSM::use('Shop')->set/get/delete`. **MUST NOT** `$_SESSION` / `session_start()`. See `AIRULES/20`.

## Config fallbacks (in initialize)

```php
Config::module('Shop', 'limit') ?? Config::module('Shop', 'limit', 20);
```

## Schema

Use versioned `Installation.php` + module-owned installations table. Do **not** call `DB::migrate()`. Do **not** require DACore unless asked. `$qb->raw()`: **every** `?` is a placeholder, including comments — **MUST NOT** write `SMS?` in `COMMENT`. See `AIRULES/06-DATABASE.md`.

## Generate via CLI

`php dotapper.php --module=Shop --create-controller=Home` (module flag first).

After editing PHP in this module: **MUST** `AIRULES/00` §2c finish gate (CRC once vs middleware, enc IDs, bindings, `data(true)`, `Events::trigger` vs `.hooks`).

## Hooks (MUST)

After a **useful** side-effect (SMS/mail sent, payment, lockout — **not** every save) **MUST** `Events::trigger('module.{lowercase_modulename}.{hook_name}.hook', $payload)` with the `Hook:`/`Why:`/`About:`/`Params:`/`Use:` block and **MUST** document that name in **`app/modules/<ThisModule>/.hooks`**. Payload = ids/counts/flags — never secrets. Listen to another module in **your** `module.listeners.php` after reading **their** `.hooks` — do not patch them. `Listeners::initializeRoutes()` may cover the producer URL. Pre-action stop = `Events::triggerWithVeto()` + `new Veto(...)`. `AIRULES/41-MODULE-HOOKS.md`, EX-16.

## Extender (judge — not every method)

**MUST NOT** Extender every method. Owner: `Extender::exists()` then immediate `return Extender::call(...)`. Extender: register `Extender::extend()` in **`Listeners::register()`** before Module initialization; explicit target URLs in `Listeners::initializeRoutes()`; own Module routes only or `[]`; prefer `'Module:Controller@method!'`. **MUST NOT** use `['*']` just to attach, `.loaded` for an initialize-time point, Events, `$request`/secrets, or duplicate registration. `AIRULES/12-SERVICES.md` §10, `AIRULES/00` §2h, EX-17.
